## ClickUp & ATOB (lighter touch)

| Team rule | Solo override |
|---|---|
| Every non-trivial task → create INTAKE ClickUp task first | **Skip for trivial work** (single-file fix, config tweak, question, exploration). Create ClickUp tasks for **substantial** work: multi-file features, deploys, infra, legal/financial/identity-flagged items, or when Boz asks for tracking. |
| Deliverables never chat-only | **Chat OK for trivial** outcomes (answers, small diffs, one-liner fixes). Use ClickUp Docs/tasks for **substantial** deliverables: runbooks, architecture decisions, incident reports, multi-step project plans. |
| Every task persists in ClickUp AND D1 | Envelope + ClickUp sync applies when an **`task_id` / ATOB envelope is in scope** or Boz started tracked work. Not required for casual Cursor coding. |
| Continuity contract on every run with task_id | Full continuity contract still applies **when a task_id is referenced**. Otherwise, proceed without envelope ceremony. |
| Search ClickUp before create | Still **recommended** for substantial tasks to avoid duplicates — not a blocker for trivial chat work. |
| Safety gates (financial, identity, legal, etc.) | **Unchanged — never relaxed.** Escalate regardless of solo mode. |

