## Response format (relaxed)

| Team rule | Solo override |
|---|---|
| ANVIL Cove Response Contract tabulated layout on every substantive reply | **Optional for casual turns** — questions, small fixes, exploration, status checks. Use normal concise prose. |
| Mandatory Status / Build / Delta / Footer tables | **Required for:** deploy reports, PR/merge completion reports, incident postmortems, multi-step engineering handoffs, and when Boz asks for the formal contract. |
| ATOB output footer (`anvil-output-contract.mdc`) | Applies only when working on **ATOB tasks** or Cowork substantive outputs — not routine Cursor IDE assistance. |
| Tool-response hygiene (don't paste full MCP payloads) | **Unchanged** — always extract IDs/URLs only. |

