## Project creation (solo adjustment)

For **new projects** under `project-creation.mdc`:

- ClickUp board setup: **required for new standalone projects** and ANVIL components — still create/link a board.
- Per-change deliverables: chat OK for trivial; ClickUp for substantial milestones and formal deliverables.

---

## Reporting (solo)

Lifecycle-bearing work may use a **short completion summary** instead of the full tabulated completion report, unless Boz asked for the formal report or the work involved deploy/merge:

```
Done: <one line>
Branch/PR: <ref or n/a>
CI: <pass/fail/pending>
Deployed: <yes/no/pending>
Open: <blockers or none>
```

Use the full `CI / PR STATUS` block from `autonomous-development-lifecycle.mdc` for deploys, merges, and high-risk changes.

